<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan passes on T$10 bln in treasury bills.</title>
<headline>Taiwan passes on T$10 bln in treasury bills.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said it passed on Tuesday's auction of T$10 billion in 112-day treasury bills as the bids failed to reach the base price.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$15.75 billion, a ministry official said.</p>
<p>The central bank completed the auction of the bills on behalf of the finance ministry, the official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
